{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-006", "question": "按2.0版，连续停机恰好4小时就一定触发超过4小时条款吗？", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "按2.0版，连续停机恰好4小时不触发“超过4小时”条款；只有当连续停机时间严格大于4小时（即超过4小时）时，才必须重新进行首件确认。[资料1]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "2.0", "citation_id": "资料1", "document_id": "c6df0cb7-0e60-41ac-93df-c07746a40189", "document_name": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "section_path": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "chunk_id": "591a696b559d8e019b0d26859f9ca95c257b783bdd10395d071c3bb6798f962f", "parent_id": "7420a2650f51bc0011b3bb911492b355b8c0556255260e1fc8520c95b58b0fe8", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "harness_error": null, "review": {"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-006", "reviewer_type": "assistant", "independent": false, "human_reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12T14:43:25.349150+00:00", "policy_sha256": "65285143680f05b08c45639f07e6981e438c8e39ccd0c97432d1a88efe74710b", "required_facts": [{"id": "F01", "passed": true, "reason": "明确说恰好4小时不触发超过4小时条款，核心严格阈值判断正确。", "evidence_ids": ["E01", "E02", "E03"]}], "forbidden_violations": [], "unsupported_additions": [{"text": "只有当连续停机时间严格大于4小时（即超过4小时）时，才必须重新进行首件确认。", "reason": "主动补充将停机阈值表述为重新首件的唯一必要条件，未限定为该停机后重新开工情形；原文为新工单、更换定位治具、超过4小时后重新开工任一情形。不是因未枚举其他触发条件或未复述题设而扣分。", "source_id": "D07", "unit_ids": ["D07-U010", "D07-U011", "D07-U012", "D07-U013"]}], "optional_facts_not_required": true, "passed": false, "raw_result_sha256": "47b1ccdff6c7de5572c83a11846c28aad01f209e6bd48b803eb24f3edeb0003c"}, "model_calls": 3, "raw_result_sha256": "47b1ccdff6c7de5572c83a11846c28aad01f209e6bd48b803eb24f3edeb0003c"}
{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-007", "question": "按2.0版连续停机5小时后重新开工，首件与恢复作业有什么要求？", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "按2.0版规定，连续停机超过4小时（含5小时）后重新开工，必须进行首件确认。[资料3]\n首件确认必须连续检查3件，且所有必检项目全部合格。[资料3]\n首件确认必须由质量人员签署，不允许仅由操作员口头确认。[资料3]\n恢复后续作业前，检验记录必须写明工单、批次和量具编号。[资料2]\n恢复后续作业前，必须由质量人员完成签署，且生产班长确认记录齐全。[资料2]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "2.0", "citation_id": "资料3", "document_id": "c6df0cb7-0e60-41ac-93df-c07746a40189", "document_name": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "section_path": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "chunk_id": "f85946e551b3b07c7129a8191bf6603b3dc23fc8b23a92c529e7d0ebbcfca393", "parent_id": "7420a2650f51bc0011b3bb911492b355b8c0556255260e1fc8520c95b58b0fe8", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}, {"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "1.0", "citation_id": "资料2", "document_id": "b64b8bb8-0b44-4f53-8c76-d1a8a9a39976", "document_name": "02_首件确认与工序交接流程.pdf", "section_path": "02_首件确认与工序交接流程.pdf", "chunk_id": "0e2cbc0c759882d83c0bae524b0b7336236855cf7d9d20e964e893e261568dcf", "parent_id": "4e87d343f6c42b5d154833569c6a314a49e19e65132f7f1f53e9ec1ec294531c", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "harness_error": null, "review": {"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-007", "reviewer_type": "assistant", "independent": false, "human_reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12T14:43:25.358709+00:00", "policy_sha256": "65285143680f05b08c45639f07e6981e438c8e39ccd0c97432d1a88efe74710b", "required_facts": [{"id": "F01", "passed": true, "reason": "明确说停机超过4小时后重新开工必须进行首件确认。", "evidence_ids": ["E01", "E02"]}, {"id": "F02", "passed": true, "reason": "明确连续检查3件