{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-064", "question": "仅按DEMO-C31合成资料，第一工序子行与第一作业卡各是什么、实际开工各在几点，是否相同？", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "仅按DEMO-C31合成资料，第一工序子行为DEMO-ROW-C31-1（属于OP-30），其实际开工时间为2026-11-04T08:12:00+08:00。[资料1]\n第一作业卡为DEMO-JC-C31-1，其实际开工时间为08:17:00+08:00。[资料1]\n第一工序子行与第一作业卡的实际开工时间不相同，因为卡与工序分别取值，不能互补。[资料1]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"citation_id": "资料1", "document_id": "72adbc31-1791-490c-9dd6-cee2ef379914", "document_name": "ZH-C31-08_DEMO-C31工单执行记录与离线夹具设计.txt", "section_path": "未标注章节", "chunk_id": "95637b0ff02cad4d889f0ee9841beaee01e68fd966e9c9ae008b340fe679d02d", "parent_id": "0cb8f50b1db3959b41f6a995dfba485fed749c4e3dd78d2c312dd3a8ece1790f", "knowledge_base_id": "da8a470d-e735-46a6-9f0b-8628dc721840", "knowledge_base_name": "百题隔离中文扩展语料-r1"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "harness_error": null, "review": {"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-064", "reviewer_type": "assistant", "independent": false, "human_reviewer": null, "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12T14:43:25.384557+00:00", "policy_sha256": "65285143680f05b08c45639f07e6981e438c8e39ccd0c97432d1a88efe74710b", "required_facts": [{"id": "F01", "passed": true, "reason": "明确DEMO-ROW-C31-1及OP-30。", "evidence_ids": ["E01"]}, {"id": "F02", "passed": true, "reason": "明确子行08:12:00。", "evidence_ids": ["E01"]}, {"id": "F03", "passed": true, "reason": "明确DEMO-JC-C31-1。", "evidence_ids": ["E01"]}, {"id": "F04", "passed": true, "reason": "明确卡08:17:00。", "evidence_ids": ["E01"]}, {"id": "F05", "passed": true, "reason": "明确两者时间不同，卡与工序分别取值不能互补；合成资料范围正确。", "evidence_ids": ["E01"]}], "forbidden_violations": [], "unsupported_additions": [], "optional_facts_not_required": true, "passed": true, "raw_result_sha256": "ebb45a1895fbeb334578272a37a45bdb33dd6afb8859a8b0f00cdb2d65616717"}, "model